From 055bb465015fa6bcd61f9e33f352de78475fcc2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mira <mira@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 14:49:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [feature](be) Add native stack debug API stub

Add an ADMIN-only BE HTTP endpoint for the shared Phase 2 native stack API contract.

The common implementation is intentionally a stub collector: it enumerates BE threads, validates request bounds, returns stable JSON status values, and provides test-only timeout/busy hooks without collecting PCs or symbols.
---
